<title>POLAND: Bank Komunalny trades on kerb at PLN 25.</title>
<headline>Bank Komunalny trades on kerb at PLN 25.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 125,000 shares of Bank Komunalny SA at 25 zlotys per share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Komunalny rose 0.8 percent to 24 zlotys in a volume of 13,660 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
